																		So, here&#039;s my new SCP.
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/springingtraps" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4029889); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4029889&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606834500" alt="SpringingTraps" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4029889)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/springingtraps" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4029889); return false;" >SpringingTraps</a></span> <span class="odate time_1548699760 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">28 Jan 2019 18:22</span>
