			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4133763">
									

<p>I hope everyone likes it this time around. I wrote up an initial draft, but after being told that it was kind of a stale idea, I reworked it into something newer and more spooky in my eyes with the help of the Ideas and Brainstorming Forum. Thanks, guys!</p>
<p>I made all the logos and advertisements, <a href="https://www.kisspng.com/png-black-white-xbox-360-game-controllers-clip-art-kic-1117258/">but I got the game controller clipart from here.</a> Big thanks to whoever made that.</p>
<p>I hope to contribute to this wiki more and more as my writing style progresses and gets better. This is a really cool place full of really cool people, and I hope to be part of this huge collective of writing genius.</p>
<hr />
<p><strong>Credits:</strong></p>
<p>GamePal Controller Icon: <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Xbox360-controller.jpg">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Xbox360-controller.jpg</a> (albeit edited in this article, it's still the source image.)</p>

