It was deleted</p>
<p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Edit: It's been a while now, can we get a reason why the experiment log was deleted?</span></p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼&nbsp;Update</a></div>
