<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Well, at least we got a reason for its deletion. it's still sad to me since there could have been many interesting logs there that further explain some aspects of the SCP such as:</p>
<p>What are SCP-4072's specific requirements for something to be considered gaming software?</p>
<p>To which extent SCP improve the narrative of a story?</p>
<p>What's the story about the ghost-like entity?</p>
<p>In which way does quality settings affect the effects of anomalous software?</p>
<p>How does it work with online games or MMOs?</p>
<p>To which extent can SCP-4072-X instances affect people?</p>
<p>And many more.</p>
</div>
